  "id": "lcu",
  "term": "LCU",
  "definition": "LCU, or learning-centred use, refers to using generative AI in a way that stays focused on the academic task and supports learning rather than replacing the student’s own work. It treats AI use as a learner-managed practice in which the student keeps responsibility for planning, monitoring, checking, and revising.",
